
[TestRule/invalid-0 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: singleImplementation (1:18 - 1:27)
Message: `Repository` is implemented only by `PostgresRepository` (../../fixtures/a.ts). Interfaces must be implemented by at least 2 classes.
Help: With one implementing class, nothing can be substituted for it: the interface and the class change together, and readers following `Repository` reach the contract instead of the code.
   1 | export interface Repository { find(): string }
     |                  ~~~~~~~~~~
