[TestRule/invalid-1 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: unimplementedInterface (1:11 - 1:21)
Message: No class implements `ButtonProps`. Interfaces must be implemented by at least 2 classes.
Help: Only `implements` clauses count, including those of base classes and of interfaces that extend this one. A shape that classes do not implement can be a `type` alias.
   1 | interface ButtonProps { label: string }
     |           ~~~~~~~~~~~
