Diagnostic 2: singleImplementation (2:18 - 2:22)
Message: `Solid` is implemented only by `Cube` (../../fixtures/file.ts). Interfaces must be implemented by at least 2 classes.
Help: With one implementing class, nothing can be substituted for it: the interface and the class change together, and readers following `Solid` reach the contract instead of the code.
